### Rapida Quickstart API - HTTP Requests Examples

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Variables
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### 1. Root - Hello World
GET {{baseUrl}}/api?lang=en
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Register Init - Send registration email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register-init
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### 3. Signup - Complete registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "registerToken": "your-register-token"
}

### 4. Login - Local authentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Google Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "google-id-token-here"
}

### 6. Apple Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/apple/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "apple-id-token-here"
}

### 7. Switch Role (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/switch-role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 8. Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### 9. Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "reset-token-here",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 10. Create User (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 11. Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get All Users (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get User by ID (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/64f8b1234567890abcdef123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Check if User Has Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/has-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Change Password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "oldpassword123",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 16. Restore Own Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Update User (Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/64f8b1234567890abcdef123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "isEmailVerified": true
}

### 18. Soft Delete Own Profile
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Soft Delete User (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/64f8b1234567890abcdef123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Create User by Invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/invitation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invited@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "invitationToken": "invitation-token-here"
}

### 21. Create Person Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/person-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "personName": "João Silva",
  "personNickname": "João",
  "gender": "Male",
  "birthday": "1990-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "maritalStatus": "Single",
  "motherName": "Maria Silva",
  "fatherName": "José Silva",
  "tagId": ["developer", "senior"],
  "personDescription": "Experienced software developer",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "phoneNumberOne": "+5511999999999",
  "emailOne": "joao@example.com"
}

### 22. Get Person Profile by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/person-profiles/user/64f8b1234567890abcdef123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Update Person Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/person-profiles/64f8b1234567890abcdef123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "personName": "João Silva Santos",
  "personDescription": "Senior software developer with 10+ years experience"
}

### 24. Create Company Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/company-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "cnpj": "12345678000195",
  "companyName": "Tech Solutions Ltda",
  "businessName": "Tech Solutions",
  "legalNature": "LTDA",
  "companyDescription": "Software development company",
  "tagId": ["technology", "software"],
  "partners": [
    {
      "partnerName": "João Silva",
      "partnerDocument": "12345678901",
      "partnerEmail": "joao@techsolutions.com",
      "participationPercentage": 50,
      "isMainPartner": true
    }
  ]
}

### 25. Get Company Profile by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/company-profiles/user/64f8b1234567890abcdef123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. Create Invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invitations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "role": "Person",
  "message": "Welcome to our platform!",
  "expirationDays": 7
}

### 27. Get Invitation by Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invitations/token/invitation-token-here

### 28. Accept Invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invitations/accept/invitation-token-here

### 29. Resend Invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invitations/64f8b1234567890abcdef123/resend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Reminder: You're invited to join our platform!"
}

### 30. Create SMS Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sms-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+5511999999999",
  "expirationMinutes": 5
}

### 31. Verify SMS Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sms-codes/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+5511999999999",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 32. Check Phone Verification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sms-codes/check/+5511999999999

### 33. Remove Test Users
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cleanup/test-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 34. Remove Expired Invitations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cleanup/expired-invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 35. Remove Expired SMS Codes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cleanup/expired-sms-codes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 36. Perform Full Cleanup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cleanup/full
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 37. Get Cleanup Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cleanup/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}